@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "customer.license.integration"

Feature: Customer To Provisioning License Integration
	Testing to assure that customer license management works properly.

Setup:
	* I get all test passwords and admin emails
#	* I teardown the licenses on customer in account "2022 FIFA World Cup Qatar - FAN ID" with the following values
#	| Activation Key Name |

Scenario: View DXP Production license on customer
    Testing the DXP Production license integration from customer to provisioning

	Given I log into the customer homepage as "${staticCustomerAdminEmailAddress}" with password "${staticCustomerAdminPassword}"
	And I search the customer projects page using the keyword "FIFA"
	Then I should be able to view the following project "2022 FIFA World Cup Qatar - FAN ID" values in the customer project details page
	| Name           | 2022 FIFA World Cup Qatar - FAN ID |
	| Code           | FIFAWCQATAR                        |
	| State          | Active                             |
	| Support Region | Hungary                            |
	| Ends On        | Mar 30, 2023                       |
	And I click on the project with the name "2022 FIFA World Cup Qatar - FAN ID" on the customer project details page
	And I choose the "DXP" subscription at the product activation tab
	And I click on the generate activation key button on activation keys index
	And I populate the activation key form with the following values
	| Product          | Select       | DXP                         |
	| Version          | Select       | 7.4                         |
	| Key Type         | Select       | OEM                         |
	| Subscription     | Radio Button | Jun 30, 2021 - Mar 30, 2023 |
	And I click on the next button on generate activation key form
	And I populate the activation key form with the following values
	| Environment Name | Input        | Activation Key Name         |
	| Description      | Input        | Activation Key Description  |
	| Host Name        | Input        | localhost                   |
	| IP Address       | Textarea     | 123.45.67.89                |
	| MAC Address      | Textarea     | 0A-1B-2C-3D-4E-5F           |
	And I click on the generate button on the generate activation key form